<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Bongstar Games | Official Satire Portal</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background-color: #0b0b0b;
      color: #ffffff;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* Navigation Bar */
    header {
      background-color: #000000;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #222;
      padding: 15px 5%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    .logo-box {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .badge {
      background-color: #fcaf17; /* Classic Rockstar Gold */
      color: #000000;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      border: 2px solid #ffffff;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .brand-name {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    nav a {
      color: #cccccc;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 25px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: #fcaf17;
    }

    /* Hero Banner */
    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(0,0,0,0.9), rgba(0,0,0,0.3)), 
                  radial-gradient(circle at top right, #2e4a1e, #0b0b0b);
      padding: 100px 5%;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #222;
    }

    .hero-tag {
      color: #fcaf17;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      line-height: 1.1;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero p {
      color: #bbbbbb;
      max-width: 550px;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: transparent;
      color: #ffffff;
      border: 2px solid #ffffff;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-decoration: none;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      background-color: #fcaf17;
      border-color: #fcaf17;
      color: #000000;
    }

    /* Featured Games Grid */
    .section {
      padding: 60px 5%;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      border-left: 5px solid #fcaf17;
      padding-left: 15px;
    }

    .games-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .game-card {
      background-color: #161616;
      border: 1px solid #2a2a2a;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: transform 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
    }

    .game-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      border-color: #fcaf17;
    }

    .card-banner {
      height: 220px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .gtb-bg {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1b4332, #081c15);
      color: #95d5b2;
      text-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #000;
    }

    .rdw-bg {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7f1d1d, #2b0909);
      color: #fca5a5;
      text-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #000;
    }

    .bully-bg {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a, #0f172a);
      color: #fde047;
      text-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #000;
    }

    .card-body {
      padding: 25px;
    }

    .card-body h3 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .card-body p {
      color: #aaaaaa;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #262626;
      color: #fcaf17;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* Newswire / Satire News */
    .news-item {
      background-color: #161616;
      border: 1px solid #2a2a2a;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .news-date {
      color: #fcaf17;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      background-color: #000000;
      border-top: 1px solid #222;
      padding: 40px 5%;
      text-align: center;
      color: #666666;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Header -->
  <header>
    <a href="#" class="logo-box">
      <div class="badge">B★</div>
      <span class="brand-name">Bongstar Games</span>
    </a>
    <nav>
      <a href="#games">Games</a>
      <a href="#newswire">Newswire</a>
      <a href="#merch">Stash</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-tag">Official Announcement</div>
    <h1>Grand Theft Bong VI: Trailer 2 Delayed Again</h1>
    <p>Return to Vice City's chillest dispensaries. Experience next-gen couch-lock physics and 4K snack-run missions—coming whenever we finish rolling.</p>
    <a href="#games" class="btn">Explore Franchises</a>
  </section>

  <!-- Featured Games -->
  <section id="games" class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Featured Franchises</h2>
    <div class="games-grid">
      
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="game-card">
        <div class="card-banner gtb-bg">Grand Theft Bong</div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <span class="tag">Open-World Satire</span>
          <h3>Grand Theft Bong V</h3>
          <p>Three low-motivation criminals pull off daring late-night drive-thru heists across the sunny streets of Los Santos.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="game-card">
        <div class="card-banner rdw-bg">Red Dead Weedemption</div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <span class="tag">Western Adventure</span>
          <h3>Red Dead Weedemption 2</h3>
          <p>Outlaws on the run in 1899 America. Ride across the frontier, set up camp, and pass the peace pipe with the Van der Linde gang.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="game-card">
        <div class="card-banner bully-bg">Bongstar Classics</div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <span class="tag">Bonus Title</span>
          <h3>L.A. Noire: Hotbox Edition</h3>
          <p>Interrogate suspects through a thick cloud of mystery in 1940s Los Angeles.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Newswire -->
  <section id="newswire" class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Bongstar Newswire</h2>
    <div class="news-item">
      <div class="news-date">November 24, 2026</div>
      <h3>GTB Online: The Taco Truck Heist Update Now Live</h3>
      <p>Earn double XP and triple snack-cash on all midnight delivery missions this week.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="news-item">
      <div class="news-date">November 10, 2026</div>
      <h3>Red Dead Weedemption Online: Naturalist & Herbalist Role</h3>
      <p>Forage rare frontier herbs and brew custom tonics at your wilderness campsite.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer>
    <p>Bongstar Games &copy; 2026. Parody & Satire Fan Project. Not affiliated with Rockstar Games or Take-Two Interactive.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
